SUMMARY:Speak.
DTSTART:20251019T190000Z
DTEND:20251019T210500Z
DTSTAMP:20251019T190000Z
UID:Q4QenulJBI
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 103 mins (1h43m)\n\nSIFF DocFest Five bold young voi
 ces go on a high-stakes journey to conquer the Super Bowl of public speaki
 ng\, offering a masterclass in courage\, conviction\, and the kind of hope
  that refuses to be silenced. A DocFest Spotlight Screening\, presented wi
 th the Schultz Family Foundation in partnership with the National Speech a
 nd Debate Association. Co-director Guy Mossman\, producer Pamela Griner\, 
 and special guests scheduled to attend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-a
 nd-events/docfest/speak
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
